\v 11 Then Elkanah¦126021 \add and his family\add* returned to \add #their\add* home¦126025 in Ramah¦126022, but¦126020 young Shemuel \add stayed to\add* help Eli¦126035 the priest¦126036 serve¦126028 Yahweh¦126031.
\s1 Eli's greedy sons
