\p
\v 15 Then¦126819 Shemuel¦126831 lay¦126819 down \add again\add* until¦126821 the morning¦126823 when he opened¦126824 the doors¦126827 of Yahweh's¦126830 house¦126828 \add as usual\add*, \add ≈but¦126819\add* \add *he\add* was¦126832 scared to tell¦126833 Eli¦126839 about the vision¦126836.
