\p “Here¦126850 I am¦126850,” he \add ≈answered\add*.
\p
\v 17 “What¦126853 did he tell you?” \add @Eli\add* \add ≈asked\add*. “Don't¦126858 hide it from me¦126862. May¦126864 God¦126867 \add ≈punish you severely\add* if¦126870 you hide a \add single\add* word¦126874 from \add ≈everything\add* he told you.”
