\p
\v 17 “Yisrael¦127262 fled¦127261 \add ≈defeated\add* from the Philistines¦127264,” said¦127260 the messenger¦127259. “And¦127265 also¦127265, there has been a terrible slaughter¦127266 of our people¦127269. \add ≈What's more\add*, your¦127273 two¦127272 sons¦127273, Hofni¦127275 and Finehas, \add ≈were killed\add*, and the \add ≈sacred chest¦127277 has been captured\add*.”
