\v 18 \add ≈The moment\add* he mentioned¦127283 the capturing of God's box¦127287, \add @Eli\add* fell¦127289 backwards¦127293 off the seat¦127292 beside the city gate¦127297. Because¦127301 he was¦127303 old¦127303 and \add very\add* heavy¦127305, his neck¦127299 broke¦127298 and he died¦127300. Eli had¦127307 \add ≈led\add* Yisrael¦127310 for forty¦127311 years.
