\v 19 \add ≈Now\add* Finehas' wife¦127315 (\add @Eli's\add* daughter-in-law¦127314) was¦127318 pregnant¦127318—about to¦127319 give¦127319 birth—\add ≈when\add* she heard¦127320 the news¦127323 about the \add ≈sacred chest¦127327\add* being¦127326 taken¦127326, and that \add both\add* her father-in-law¦127330 and her husband¦127331 had¦127329 died¦127329. \add ≈At that moment,\add* she knelt down¦127332 and gave¦127333 birth \add ≈because¦127334 the birth pains¦127338 suddenly started\add*.
\v 20 \add ≈But she was dying¦127341\add*, and¦127340 the women who¦127343 stood¦127343 over her said¦127342, “Don't¦127345 be¦127347 afraid¦127347, because¦127348 you've¦127350 given birth to a son¦127349.” \add ≈But\add* she didn't¦127345 answer¦127352 \add ≈or pay any attention¦127343\add*.
