\v 17 The¦128019 gold¦128020 \add replicas\add* of¦128019 tumours that¦128021 the Philistines¦128023 sent¦128022 back¦128022 as a guilt¦128024 offering¦128024 to¦128025 Yahweh¦128025 were for \add the five cities\add*: Ashdod¦128026, Gaza¦128029, Ashkelon¦128031, Gat¦128033, and¦128018 Ekron¦128035.
\v 18 And¦128039 the gold¦128040 mice¦128039 were from the number¦128041 of¦128041 all¦128042 the Philistine cities \add ≈under\add* the five¦128046 rulers¦128047, including¦128039 fortified¦128049 cities as \add ≈well\add* as the villages¦128051 in the open country¦128052, and as far as the large¦128056 stone that¦128057 they¦128058 sat Yahweh's¦128062 box¦128061 on¦128066. (It's \add still\add* in Yehoshua's field¦128066 in Beyt-Shemesh until¦128063 this day¦128064.)
