\p
\v 20 The¦128099 Beyt¦128100-Shemesh¦128102 men said¦128098, “Who¦128103 can stand¦128105 in¦128106 front¦128106 of the face¦128106 of Yahweh¦128107, this¦128110 holy¦128109 God¦128108? And¦128111 \add ≈where should we send the box to¦128111 from¦128115 here\add*?”
