\c 7
\p
\v 1 \add ≈So¦128138\add* the men from Kiriat¦128142-Yearim came¦128138 and lifted up¦128143 Yahweh's¦128147 box¦128146 and brought¦128148 it into Abinadab's¦128153 house¦128152 on¦128154 the hill¦128154. They consecrated¦128159 his son¦128158 Eleazar¦128157 to¦128160 \add ≈take¦128143 care of¦128163\add* \add *it\add*.\x + \xo 7:1: \xt 2Sam 6:2-4; 1Ch 13:5-7.\x*
\s1 Shemuel guides Yisrael
