\v 9 \add ≈So¦128323\add* Shemuel¦128324 got a \add ≈young\add* lamb¦128325 and offered it up—a whole¦128331 burnt¦128330 up offering to Yahweh. And¦128333 \add *he¦128333\add* cried¦128333 out¦128333 to Yahweh for¦128338 Yisrael¦128339, and Yahweh answered¦128340 him¦128340.
