\v 19 \add ≈However,\add* the¦128775 people¦128775 refused¦128774 to \add ≈consider Shemuel's advice\add* and¦128779 they¦128779 \add ≈argued\add*, “No¦128780, \add ≈we want\add* a king¦128784 over¦128786 us¦128786
