\v 6 \add ≈But¦128957\add* he \add ≈replied\add*, “Listen, please¦128961. There's an honoured¦128968 man¦128962 of¦128962 God¦128964 in¦128965 this¦128966 city¦128965. \add ≈Everything he says¦128957 comes¦128974 true\add*. Let's go¦128976 there¦128977 now. Perhaps¦128978 he'll tell¦128979 us \add ≈which¦128984 way we¦128986 should¦128976 have¦128986 gone\add*.”
