\v 7 “\add ≈Okay, then¦128989.\add* We can go¦128993 \add there\add*,” Sha'ul¦128990 \add ≈responded¦128989\add*, “but¦128989 what¦128994 \add ≈can we give\add* the man¦128997? \add ≈We don't¦129003 have any more food¦128999 in our¦129001 bags¦129001, and¦128989 we never brought along a gift¦129002. What¦129008 else do we have?\add*”
