\p \add ≈So\add* Sha'ul ate¦129373 with¦129375 Shemuel that¦129359 day¦129378,
\v 25 and then¦129381 they¦129381 went¦129381 \add back\add* from¦129382 the high¦129382 place¦129382 down into the city¦129383, and \add @Shemuel\add* spoke¦129384 with¦129385 Sha'ul¦129387 on¦129388 \add his house\add* roof¦129390.
