\v 26 They¦129392 rose¦129392 early¦129392 \add the next day\add*. At dawn¦129395, Shemuel¦129397 had called¦129396 to Sha'ul on the roof¦129401, saying¦129403, “Get up and I will send¦129405 you¦129405 \add ≈off\add*.” \add ≈So¦129392\add* Sha'ul got up, and the two of¦129409 them¦129409 went¦129408 outside¦129412.
