\v 1 Then Yahweh¦132959 spoke to Shemuel¦132962, “\add ≈How long are¦132966 you going to keep mourning¦132967 for Sha'ul¦132970 for\add*, when I myself have¦132972 rejected¦132972 him¦132972 as king over¦132974 Yisrael¦132976? Fill¦132977 your¦132978 horn¦132978 with¦132991 oil¦132979 and¦132980 go¦132980. I'll¦132981 send¦132981 you to Yishay¦132984 (Jesse) from Bethlehem, because¦132988 I've¦132990 seen¦132990 \add ≈one of¦132991 his¦132991 sons¦132991 who'd make a\add* \add good\add* king for me.”
