\v 1 \add At that time,\add* the¦133414 Philistines¦133414 gathered¦133413 their¦133417 \add army\add* divisions together ready for¦133418 battle¦133418. They¦133419 assembled at¦133430 Sokoh in Yehudah¦133422, and camped¦133423 between¦133424 Sokoh and Azekah¦133429 in Efes-Dammim.
