\v 4 Then¦133461 the¦133462 Philistines¦133466 \add ≈sent a champion¦133464\add* out¦133461 from their camp \add to represent them\add*. His name¦133468 was Goliat¦133467 and he came from Gat¦133469, and he was almost three metres¦133472\f + \fr 17:4 \ft Some Greek sources have a height closer to two metres.\f* \add ≈tall\add*.
