\v 17 \add One day\add* Yishay¦133678 said¦133677 to his¦133680 son¦133680 David¦133679, “\add ≈Here's a sack\add* of roasted¦133686 grain¦133686 and ten¦133688 loaves of bread¦133689. Take¦133681 them¦133691 straight away to your brothers at the camp¦133692.
