\v 19 Sha'ul¦133714 and them and the \add ≈other warriors\add* are in¦133720 the Elah¦133719 valley¦133720, fighting¦133722 against the Philistines¦133725.”
\p
\v 20 \add ≈So¦133727\add* David¦133728 got up early¦133727 in¦133729 the morning¦133729 and left¦133730 the flock¦133733 with¦133729 a \add ≈shepherd\add*, and set out just like Yishay¦133741 had¦133740 told¦133740 him¦133740 to. \add ≈When¦133731\add* he got to the battleground and the camp¦133743, the \add ≈warriors\add* were just going¦133745 out to the battle line¦133748 and they¦133749 were shouting¦133749 \add ≈the battle cry¦133749\add*.
