\v 23 \add ≈While¦133792\add* he was talking¦133779 with them¦133780, look, the Philistine¦133786 \add ≈champion¦133783\add* from Gat¦133788 was coming¦133784 out \add ≈with his¦133787 challenge\add*. Goliat¦133785 spoke¦133793 \add ≈like he had before\add* and¦133777 David¦133797 \add ≈heard it all\add*.
\v 24 \add ≈But¦133799 when\add* the Israelis¦133801 saw¦133802 the \add ≈champion\add*, they¦133802 were \add ≈terrified\add* and¦133799 fled¦133806 \add ≈away from him¦133807\add*.
