\v 26 “What¦133856 \add was it that'll\add* be¦133858 done¦133858 for¦133859 the man¦133859 who \add ≈kills\add* this Philistine and¦133848 take's Yisrael's¦133869 disgrace away?” David¦133849 asked some of the men¦133852 standing¦133853 around him¦133854. “Because¦133870 who does that uncircumcised¦133873 Philistine \add think he is\add* that he would taunt the \add ≈army\add* of the living¦133879 God¦133878?”
