\v 55 When Sha'ul¦134450 had seen¦134449 David¦134453 going¦134454 out¦134454 to meet¦134455 \add @Goliat\add*, he'd \add ≈asked\add* Abner, the army¦134462 commander¦134461, “Whose son¦134463 is this lad, Abner?”
