\p
\v 1 After \add @David¦134535\add* had finished¦134526 speaking¦134527 to \add *the king\add*, him and¦134525 Yonatan \add ≈became close friends\add*, in¦134534 fact Yonatan \add ≈really\add* loved¦134536 him.
