\v 20 \add ≈Now\add* Sha'ul's \add other\add* daughter¦134846 Mikal loved¦134844 David¦134851, and¦134844 \add when\add* they told¦134852 \add *the¦134846 king\add*, \add ≈he was¦134854 pleased¦134854 about it¦134854\add*,
