\v 22 Then¦134882 Sha'ul¦134883 commanded¦134882 his servants, “Tell David¦134891 privately¦134892, ‘Listen, the king is pleased with¦134892 you, and¦134882 all¦134898 of¦134900 us his servants love¦134901 you. \add ≈So¦134882\add* now¦134902 \add we think that you should\add* become the king's¦134904 son-in-law¦134903.’ ”
