\p
\v 1 Then Sha'ul¦135062 \add ≈urged\add* his son¦135066 Yonatan and¦135067 all¦135069 his servants¦135071 to¦135072 \add ≈kill¦135072\add* David, \add ≈but¦135061\add* Yonatan \add ≈really liked\add* David
