\v 3 And \add ≈what I'll do\add*, I'll go¦135102 out¦135102 and stand¦135103 by my father¦135106 in¦135113 the countryside¦135107 where¦135108 you're¦135109 \add hiding\add*, and I'll \add ≈bring you into the conversation to see¦135117 what he'll say about you\add*.”
