\v 4 \add ≈So\add* \add the next morning,\add* Yonatan spoke¦135123 well of David to his father¦135130 Sha'ul¦135129, saying¦135131, “Don't¦135133 let¦135135 the king¦135136 sin¦135135 against his servant¦135137, against David, because¦135143 he hasn't sinned¦135141 against you, and¦135143 actually, \add ≈he's been a big help\add* to you.
