\v 6 Sha'ul¦135179 listened¦135178 to Yonatan, then¦135178 \add *he\add* promised, “As surely as Yahweh¦135186 lives, he won't be¦135189 put¦135189 to death¦135189.”
\v 7 \add Afterwards,\add* Yonatan called¦135191 David and told¦135194 him¦135212 \add ≈what had been said\add*. Then¦135191 he brought¦135203 David back \add to work for\add* Sha'ul¦135210 and \add ≈things carried on as¦135213 before¦135212\add*.
