\p
\v 8 Then war¦135218 \add ≈broke out\add* again, and David¦135221 went¦135220 out and battled against¦135223 the Philistines¦135223 and defeated¦135224 them¦135225 \add ≈so badly that\add* they¦135228 fled¦135228 away from¦135229 \add ≈him¦135229\add*.
