\v 10 Sha'ul¦135249 tried to¦135250 hit David with¦135251 the spear, but¦135248 David eluded¦135254 him and the spear went into the wall¦135261. Then¦135248 David slipped away and fled¦135263 that¦135266 night¦135265.
