\v 2 “Far¦135577 from it,” Yonatan \add ≈responded¦135575\add*. “You¦135579 won't¦135578 die¦135579. Listen, my father doesn't do \add ≈anything¦135586, big or¦135588 small¦135590, without telling me\add*. \add ≈So¦135575\add* why would my father hide¦135597 this from me \add if it was his plan\add*? \add No,\add* \add ≈you're wrong\add*.”
