\v 3 “For sure, your father¦135613 knows¦135612 that¦135624 \add ≈you've taken a liking to me\add*,” said David, “and he¦135619 \add ≈would have¦135616 decided not¦135620 to tell you so you wouldn't be¦135628 upset\add*.” Then¦135607 David made an oath again¦135608, “Indeed, as Yahweh¦135632 is alive, and as your soul¦135634 is alive, death¦135639 \add ≈is definitely only a step¦135636 away from me\add*.”
