\v 5 “Listen, the new¦135662 moon¦135662 \add celebration\add* is tomorrow¦135663, and \add ≈I'll definitely be expected to\add* sit with¦135674 the king¦135670 to eat¦135671,” David¦135656 told \add *him\add*. “\add ≈But¦135655\add* you¦135672 \add should\add* let¦135672 me¦135672 go¦135672, and I'll hide¦135673 myself¦135673 in¦135674 the countryside¦135674 until¦135675 the third¦135677 evening¦135676.\x + \xo 20:5: \xt Num 28:11.\x*
