\v 9 “\add ≈Don't¦135769 even think of it\add*,” Yonatan \add ≈responded¦135751\add*. “If I find out that¦135761 my¦135766 father¦135766 \add ≈has¦135763 decided to¦135767 harm¦135764\add* you, I'll¦135760 \add ≈certainly\add* tell¦135771 you.”
