\v 11 “Come¦135796 \add ≈with me\add* out to the countryside.” Yonatan \add ≈replied\add*. \add ≈So\add* they¦135799 went¦135799 out to the countryside together
\v 12 and¦135804 \add *he¦135804\add* \add ≈promised\add* David¦135808, “By Yahweh¦135809 the¦135810 god¦135810 of¦135810 Yisrael¦135811, I will¦135814 definitely sound¦135814 out¦135814 my¦135817 father¦135817 around this time¦135818 tomorrow¦135820, or \add ≈soon after\add*. If \add ≈it looks\add* good¦135824 for \add *you\add*, then¦135830 I'll¦135814 certainly send¦135831 \add ≈a message to¦135832 let you know\add*.
