\v 2 “The king \add ≈sent me on an errand\add*,” David¦136447 \add ≈replied\add*, “\add ≈but¦136446\add* he told me \add ≈not to tell anyone¦136462 about the matter that he sent me on\add*. \add ≈Plus\add* I've \add ≈told my young men where to meet¦136455 me\add*.
\v 3 \add ≈Now, what food do you have on\add* hand? Give me five loaves of bread or whatever you can find.”
