\v 6 \add ≈So\add* the priest¦136551 gave him¦136553 the sacred¦136575 bread, because¦136554 there was no other bread there other than the \add previous day's\add* bread of the presence which had been removed from \add ≈in¦136563 front\add* of Yahweh to be replaced by fresh bread.\x + \xo 21:6: \xt Lev 24:5-9.\x*
