\v 5 Then the prophet¦136898 Gad¦136897 told David, “Don't¦136902 stay in the fortress. \add ≈Leave it\add* and come¦136913 back to \add ≈Yehudah's¦136910 region¦136909\add*.” \add ≈So\add* David left and went¦136911 to the Heret¦136915 forest¦136914 \add in Yehudah\add*.
