\p
\v 6 \add One day,\add* Sha'ul¦136919 was sitting¦136927 holding his spear¦136933 underneath¦136929 the tamarisk¦136931 tree¦136931 on¦136928 a hill \add near\add* Gibeah¦136928 with¦136928 all his servants¦136937 stationed \add ≈around\add* him, \add ≈when\add* \add *he\add* heard \add ≈where\add* David¦136922 and his men¦136923 were¦136938,
