\v 8 \add Yes,\add* all of you have¦136968 conspired¦136968 against me. \add ≈Not¦136971 one¦136973 of you informed me when\add* my \add own\add* son made¦136977 a \add ≈pact\add* with¦136977 \add that\add* son of Yishay¦136984. And none¦136985 of you \add ≈took my side or even informed me\add* that my son has¦136995 \add ≈encouraged\add* my servant¦136999 to lie in¦136977 ambush¦137001 against me as¦137002 he is today!”
