\v 9 \add ≈Now\add* Doeg¦137007 the Edomite was¦137010 stationed there with Sha'ul's servants¦137013, and he¦137016 \add spoke up\add*, “I saw¦137017 Yishay's¦137022 son¦137020 go to Nob¦137024 and talk with Ahimelek the priest,\x + \xo 22:9-10: \xt 1Sam 21:7-9; Psa 52 header.\x*
