\p
\v 1 \add ≈After\add* Sha'ul returned from¦137865 \add ≈repelling\add* the Philistines, they told him that David¦137864 was \add now\add* in¦137867 the Eyn-Gedi wilderness.
\v 2 \add ≈So\add* Sha'ul¦137876 \add ≈chose\add* three thousand \add ≈Israeli warriors\add* and went \add ≈searching\add* for David¦137883 and his men at¦137884 Wild Goats Rocks.
