\v 1 \add Later on,\add* Shemuel died¦138340 and all¦138343 \add ≈the¦138357 Israelis¦138343\add* gathered¦138342 and mourned¦138346 for him, then they¦138349 buried¦138349 him at¦138350 his¦138350 house¦138350 in¦138350 Ramah¦138351.
