\v 2 \add ≈Now\add* there was a man in Maon¦138362 whose¦138363 business¦138363 was in Carmel. \add ≈He owned\add* three¦138370 thousand sheep and one¦138373 thousand goats¦138374, and was \add busy\add* shearing¦138376 his¦138379 sheep at¦138362 Carmel.
\v 3 The man's¦138383 name¦138385 was Nabal¦138384, and his¦138386 wife was Abigail¦138387. The wife was \add ≈wise and very good-looking, whereas\add* the¦138394 man (who was a Calebite) was harsh and cruel.
