\v 14 \add Meanwhile\add*, Nabal's¦138604 wife¦138603 Abigail had been informed by a \add ≈servant\add*, “Listen, David¦138613 sent¦138612 messengers¦138614 from¦138616 the¦138616 wilderness¦138616 to¦138617 greet¦138617 our¦138620 master¦138620, \add ≈but¦138602\add* he¦138621 yelled at¦138622 them¦138622.
