\v 18 \add ≈So¦138683\add* Abigail¦138684 quickly \add collected\add* two hundred loaves of bread¦138688, two skins of wine¦138692, five butchered sheep¦138694, a large basket of roasted¦138700 grain¦138700, a hundred bunches¦138702 of raisins¦138702, and¦138683 two hundred cakes¦138704 of figs. She¦138705 loaded¦138705 \add it all\add* on¦138706 donkeys¦138708
