\v 22 May¦138770 God¦138771 \add preserve\add* \add *my\add* enemies¦138772, if¦138776 I \add ≈don't eliminate\add* all¦138779 of the \add ≈older and¦138774 young men in¦138788 his household before\add* the morning¦138786.
